OL,3,AMicrosoft says email queues
OL,4,A'approaching normal levels' after
OL,5,Aglobal outage hits Outlook and Teams
OL,6,Ausers
OL,7,
OL,8,FA Microsoft outage, which has been
OL,9,Fgoing for at least 20 hours, is
OL,10,Faffecting services including Teams,
OL,11,FOutlook and AI software Copilot -
OL,12,Fhere's what we know
OL,14,FMicrosoft says it is continuing to see
OL,15,F"improvements in service availability"
OL,16,Fwith email queues "approaching normal
OL,17,Flevels" - but says some users may still
OL,18,Fhave "intermittent access issues". It
OL,19,Fsays there is no evidence "malicious
OL,20,Factivity" caused the incident
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
