OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMicrosoft says email queues
OL,4,A'approaching normal levels' after
OL,5,Aglobal outage hits Outlook and Teams
OL,6,Ausers
OL,7,
OL,8,FNHS England says the outage is
OL,9,F"inevitably" disrupting staff but
OL,10,Fappointments can continue; schools are
OL,11,Fasking parents to get in touch via
OL,12,Fphone not email; some businesses, such
OL,13,Fas Swiss luxury goods group Richemont,
OL,14,Fdelay announcing their quarterly
OL,15,Fresults
OL,17,FIn the US, local municipalities, the
OL,18,Ffederal government and court systems
OL,19,Fare among those reporting issues, with
OL,20,Fofficials saying they are unable to
OL,21,Fsend or receive emails
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
