OL,3,AMicrosoft says email queues
OL,4,A'approaching normal levels' after
OL,5,Aglobal outage hits Outlook and Teams
OL,6,Ausers
OL,7,
OL,8,FHow are you affected? Georgia, from
OL,9,FStaffordshire, says the outage has
OL,10,Fdelayed the completion of her first
OL,11,Fhouse purchase. Meanwhile, Martin says
OL,12,Fit was "bliss" to wake up to no emails
OL,13,F- before he realised "today is a
OL,14,Fcrucial day to conclude a business
OL,15,Fdeal"
